# Variables for the app's PACKAGED BUILD (Tauri desktop/mobile) -- loaded by `vite build --mode
# tauri` (see the build:app script + tauri.conf beforeBuildCommand). The packaged app has NO Vite
# proxy, so the /api and /jmap calls MUST point at the backend through an absolute URL.
#
# Local values (backend in Docker on port 8000, which serves /api AND /jmap). To ship the app to
# real users, switch to the public domain (e.g. https://app.yourcompany.com) -- and make sure that
# domain is in the backend's APP_ORIGINS (deploy/.env) so CORS accepts it.
#
# Override at build time without editing the file:  VITE_API_BASE=https://app.foo make desktop
VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
VITE_PUBLIC_BASE=http://localhost:5173
